# Only the old paths need rules here.
#
# The clean URLs (/order, /review, /bakery, /faq) are handled by Workers
# itself: with the default html_handling it serves /order from order.html and
# redirects order.html to /order. Adding our own /order -> /order.html rewrite
# on top of that made an infinite redirect loop, because Workers then bounced
# /order.html straight back to /order.

/shop.html   /order    301
/shop        /order    301
/about.html  /bakery   301
/about       /bakery   301
